  "limits": [
    "Compatibility is fail-closed: canonical positive decimal EIP-155 chains below 2^256, exactly one available EVM catalog network, acknowledged unexpired session and HTTP(S) peer metadata origin are required. Duplicate eligible catalog chains are ambiguous.",
    "Legacy queue data without captured context cannot be approved and must be requested again. WalletConnect mobile signing remains unavailable because no supported mobile forwarding path is implemented here.",
    "Normal expiry extension with the same session grant does not itself invalidate an approval. Session update/delete/expire/local-disconnect revisions do.",
    "No cancellation guarantee is claimed after provider.broadcastTransaction has been invoked. Once submission starts, failure consumes that intent to prevent a fresh-nonce replay from the same screen.",
    "Complete WalletConnect review UI remains open: full requester/account/network, untruncated content, honest fees, phishing/blind controls and large-text/compact qualification. Browser captures explicitly retain the old clipped/truncated summary.",
    "WalletConnect Polkadot has separate legacy queue/grant authorization and is not covered. Corresponding local EVM hidden population awaits also require review and remediation.",
